      "attestations": [
        {
          "text": "T'IEN Wên 田雯 (T. 子綸, 綸霞, H. 山薑, 蒙齋) July 7, 1635–1704, Mar. 28, poet, scholar and official, was a native of Tê-chou, Shantung. His father, T'ien Hsü-tsung 田緒宗 (T. 仿安, H. 蓼菴), was a chin-shih of 1652 who died in 1654 while magistrate of Li-shui, Chekiang.",
